[31m+ # YooKassa provider runbook[39m
[31m+[39m
[31m+ Status: **BLOCKED**. This runbook is an activation and recovery checklist, not permission[39m
[31m+ to activate YooKassa.[39m
[31m+[39m
[31m+ ## Current boundary[39m
[31m+[39m
[31m+ The repository contains a default-off YooKassa Merchant API client, adapter, verifier,[39m
[31m+ PostgreSQL operation mapping, webhook seam, worker reconciliation, consent-bound receipt[39m
[31m+ contact boundary, and encrypted exact-body recovery runtime. The API and worker default[39m
[31m+ composition supplies no merchant capability or recovery key resolver. Credentials and[39m
[31m+ recovery-policy inputs are empty placeholders and `YOOKASSA_ENABLED=false`; do not add a[39m
[31m+ credential, enable a flag, or deploy while hoster maintenance is active.[39m
[31m+[39m
[31m+ Production is native: systemd API and worker services, the single existing system[39m
[31m+ PostgreSQL database, and nginx/TLS. There are no production containers. Claw uses a[39m
[31m+ constrained development/test container to simulate that server; direct Claw CI and[39m
[31m+ Database Gate are the executable repository gates, and GitHub Actions are not used.[39m
[31m+[39m
[31m+ ## Activation prerequisites[39m
[31m+[39m
[31m+ All items require named owner and independent review before a separate activation change:[39m
[31m+[39m
[31m+ 1. Approved YooKassa Merchant contract, test shop, and legal entity; do not use the[39m
[31m+    personal YooMoney Wallet API or a T-Bank integration.[39m
[31m+ 2. Approved fiscal/receipt configuration, refund and chargeback policy, and data terms.[39m
[31m+ 3. Nginx peer-address trust configuration and a provider-connected webhook exercise.[39m
[31m+ 4. Test-shop evidence for create/read/refund, duplicate delivery, timeout/unknown outcome,[39m
[31m+    mode separation, and daily registry reconciliation.[39m
[31m+ 5. Confirmed secret owner and reference-only secret rotation procedure. Never put a value[39m
[31m+    in docs, Git, evidence, or logs.[39m
