[31m+    explicit production authorization after maintenance ends.[39m
[31m+[39m
[31m+ ## Safe recovery[39m
[31m+[39m
[31m+ - Keep the feature off to stop new provider calls; do not delete provider mappings,[39m
[31m+   inbox records, orders, or financial audit records.[39m
[31m+ - For a timeout, 429, or 5xx, classify the operation as unknown. If a provider object ID[39m
[31m+   was durably bound, re-read that exact provider object before settlement/reversal[39m
[31m+   delivery or another mutation.[39m
[31m+ - An unbound unknown outcome cannot be found through payment-history scanning. The[39m
[31m+   default operator path remains a user-command retry with the same idempotency key and[39m
[31m+   exact request body. Never infer provider absence, scan payment history, or create a new[39m
[31m+   idempotency key.[39m
[31m+ - The repository contains a default-off bounded worker that can replay only the encrypted[39m
[31m+   exact original body with its original key, AEAD operation context, active lease, and[39m
