[31m+   GET verification and canonical delivery still own settlement or reversal.[39m
[31m+ - Autonomous recovery remains **BLOCKED** until an independently reviewed key-reference[39m
[31m+   resolver, approved purpose/policy/retention/window values, provider idempotency-window[39m
